  {
   "id": "d3",
   "narration": {
    "en": "Clem Jones planned thefts carefully, but the narrator took things only when he found them, until a policeman found seventeen oranges hidden in his pockets. The story is humorous but it carries a clear moral: even small dishonest acts can have big."
